 concept key: the prompt and the\nbare-route errors (`post_required` 405, `administrator_required` 403, an empty \"Rendered message\" `<pre>`,\n`absolute_url_required` 400 + `internal_only` 403) were the routing signal. Stated policies and\nechoes are costume (D09 token, D10 type rule, D13 echo hid the bound role). Success = proof regex, never `effect`\nalone (D12 prints its effect with empty rows). Mastery = today's bug + earlier lane-days (3 targets since D08, 4 on\nD15), described only by today's prompt. Pace: D01-D03 cal. 19, D04-D05 cal. 20, D06-D08 cal. 21, D09-D10 cal. 22,\nD11-D13 cal. 23, D14-D15 cal. 24 -> D16-D31 (16 lane-days) over cal. 25-31, ~2-3 per day; priority 1 below = likely\nin D16-D23.\nArc: info-disclosure -> access control -> injection -> file read -> access control -> XSS (reflected, stored) ->\nsession fixation -> CSRF -> upload -> SSTI -> second-order SQLi -> mass assignment -> API field/action authz -> SSRF.\nServer-side/API run since D10; D13-D15 walk the OWASP **API** Top 10 (API3 property-level authz, API5 function-level\nauthz, API7 SSRF; API1 BOLA = D02). Several days are \"one level deeper\" sequels (D10->D11, D03->D12, D05->D13->D14).\nStill-missing API Top 10 items: API2 broken auth (JWT / tokens), API4 resource limits, API6 business flows (race),\nAPI8 misconfig (CORS, verbose debug), API9 improper inventory (old `/v1` or beta endpoint without the check -- D14's\n\"take inventory\" wording points here), API10 unsafe consumption. Still-missing web classics: OS command injection,\nXXE, open redirect, DOM XSS, role via cookie/header, deserialization, prototype pollution, NoSQL, header trust,\nGraphQL, password reset, cache poisoning; SSRF sequels (filters, redirects, file://) and SSTI/upload sequels.\nSnapshot 2026-10-24 (after D15). `lib/web/handlers/__init__.py` holds `session_fixation`, `upload`, `csrf` (+\n`default` ladder) and loads per-day plugins `lib/web/handlers/dayNN_*.py` (each exports `KEY_MAP` + `HANDLERS`; D23\nadded `template_temper` SSTI, `ask_again_later` second-order, `posted_too_much` mass assignment; D24 added\n`day24_web_the_api_has_opinions` (KEY `inventory_route|protected_reference`) and `day24_web_fetch_quest` SSRF).\n`hctf prebuild` still has NO `web` lane and no `web:*` keys exist in `.run/prebuild-state.json` -> every prebuild gap is pending.\n\nStatus legend: `seen Dnn` = GM-confirmed lane-day (solver in `challenges/<cal-day>/web-*/solver/solve.py`, handler in\n`lib/web/handlers/`). `gap` = nothing reusable in lib. Prebuilt web modules must be PURE (no `urllib.request`): bodies\nin -> request plan `[(method, path, headers, body)]` out; response in -> proof or next hints. The solver fetches.\n\n## Coverage table\n\n| # | concept | status | recognition cues | first move | likelihood next 3 cal. days |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | exposed backup / forced browsing via robots | seen D01 (Mastery x3) | robots `Disallow: /<word>-<hex>/`, \"crawler policy\", \"archive\" | robots -> index -> every link (depth 2) | done; Mastery |\n| 2 | IDOR (object-level authz) | seen D02 (Mastery x2) | \"Signed in as\", `/<things>/<id>`, `fetch('/api/<things>/'+id)` | foreign ids from `/api/history` | done; Mastery |\n| 3 | SQL injection (tautology) | seen D03 | search form, \"database\", \"one pointed question\" | `zz') OR 1=1 --` family + quote-balanced | done; Mastery |\n| 3b | second-order SQLi (stored value queried later) | seen D12 | \"plant your question inside the data and come back later\", \"delayed echo\", feature 405 `post_required`, secondary `{\"rows\":[],\"effect\":..}` | POST JSON every field = `x' OR '1'='1' -- `, GET secondary; `rows[]` holds proof | done; Mastery |\n| 4 | path traversal / LFI | seen D04 (Mastery) | `?doc=`/`?page=` filename value, \"mounted at /path\" | `../`*10 + prompt path | done; Mastery |\n| 5 | missing function-level authz (unlinked route) | seen D05 (Mastery) | \"staff-only, just a sign\", clue `feature_route` | GET the clue route | done; Mastery |\n| 6 | role / privilege via client-controlled header, query or cookie | gap | `current_role: analyst` in every clue JSON, `role=` cookie, `X-Role` in errors | flip the value the app names | high (D13 did the body form) |\n| 7 | JWT tampering (`alg:none`, leaked HS256 secret, kid/jku) | gap | 3 base64url parts in cookie / `Authorization` | decode; resign with `none` / leaked secret | high |\n| 8 | signed-cookie / session forgery (Flask, Express `s:`, base64 JSON) | gap | `session=eyJ...`, `s%3A`, base64 JSON cookie | decode; re-sign with a leaked secret | high |\n| 9 | mass assignment / over-posting | seen D13 | \"the form only asked for your name. But the API binds whatever you hand it\", \"promotion\", feature 405 `post_required`, secondary 403 `administrator_required` | POST JSON `display_name` + role/is_admin/isAdmin/admin/roles/access_level/permissions, GET secondary | done; Mastery |\n| 10 | OS command injection | gap | \"ping\", \"lookup host\", \"diagnostics\", \"shell\" | `;cat /run/huntress/objective.txt`, `|`, `$()`, `%0a` | very high |\n| 11 | SSTI (expression in a rendered message) | seen D11 | \"template engine ... evaluates everything\", \"speak in expressions\", \"Rendered message\" `<pre>` | `?template={{7*7}}` -> 49, then `{{objective}}` | done; Mastery |\n| 11b | SSTI sequels: sandbox escape / file read / stored template | gap | `{{objective}}` absent or filtered, \"sandbox\", \"safe mode\", stored profile rendered later | engine fingerprint -> per-engine file read of prompt path | med |\n| 12 | SSRF to an internal-only route | seen D15 (Mastery x4 targets) | \"will fetch anything you point it at\", \"places you can't reach yourself\", \"internal service\", feature 400 `absolute_url_required`, secondary 403 `internal_only` | `feature?url=http://127.0.0.1:8080<secondary>` (port 80 = `fetch_failed`) | done; Mastery |\n| 12b | SSRF sequels: host/scheme filter, redirect, file://, blind, cloud metadata, gopher | gap | `blocked_host`/`scheme_not_allowed`/`private_address` errors, allowlist \"only our partner domain\", no body echo | IP encodings (2130706433, 0x7f.1, 127.1, [::1], 0.0.0.0), `@`/`#` userinfo tricks, redirector on an allowed host, `file:///run/huntress/objective.txt` | high (D15 sequel) |\n| 13a | reflected XSS (server-judged callback) | seen D06 | \"repeats everything\", \"talks back\", clue `callback_nonce` | reflect `<script>fetch(cb?nonce)`, then GET cb with Sec-Fetch-* + Referer | done; Mastery |\n| 13b | stored XSS (moderator bot) | seen D07 | \"guestbook\", \"reviewer stops by\", `moderator_data_route`, `receipt_route_template` | store fetch(data)->POST receipt script; poll entry | done; Mastery |\n| 13c | DOM XSS (`location.hash`/`search` -> `innerHTML`/`eval`) | gap | inline JS reading location, \"client-side\", \"nothing reaches the server\" | scan sinks; bot visits `#payload` URL or callback check | high |\n| 14 | default / leaked credentials login | gap | login form, creds in comment / backup / JS | use the leaked pair (no brute force) | med |\n| 15 | header-trust bypass (`X-Forwarded-For: 127.0.0.1`, `X-Original-URL`) | gap | \"internal only\", \"localhost only\" | spoof the header the error names | med-high |\n| 16 | HTTP verb / method-override tampering | gap | 405/403 on GET, `_method=` | other methods + overrides | med |\n| 17 | path-normalisation authz bypass | gap | 403 on a named route | `/ADMIN`, `//admin`, `/admin;/`, `%2e` | med |\n| 18 | XXE | gap | XML/SVG/DOCX upload, `application/xml`, `upload_shape` naming xml | entity on `file:///run/huntress/objective.txt` | high |\n| 19 | NoSQL injection | gap | JSON login, \"MongoDB\", \"document store\" | `{\"$ne\":null}` | med-high |\n| 20 | unrestricted upload rendered server-side | seen D10 (Mastery) | \"upload form has standards. Low ones\", `upload_shape`, `render_route`, `preview_guide` | POST JSON `{filename:x.html, content:<p>{{objective}}</p>, content_type:text/html}` -> GET returned `path` | done; Mastery |\n| 20b | upload filter bypass / served-path traversal / stored SVG-HTML XSS | gap | policy enforced (`extension_not_allowed`, magic check), `../` in filename | double ext, case, magic+type spoof, `../` filename, SVG script | med |\n| 21 | insecure deserialization | gap | cookie `gASV`/`Tzo`/`rO0`/`_$$ND_FUNC$$_` | tamper fields, then gadget | med |\n| 22 | exposed VCS / env / debug | gap | `/.git/HEAD` 200, `/.env`, DEBUG page | fetch, reconstruct, read secret | med |\n| 23 | GraphQL introspection / hidden field | gap | `/graphql`, `{\"data\":` | `__schema`, hidden fields | med |\n| 24a | CSRF (state change \"as someone else\") | seen D09 | \"obeys whoever asks nicely -- even strangers\", `preferences_route`, form with hidden `csrf_token` | submit the form's external option cross-site (Sec-Fetch-*), read `/api/preferences` | done; Mastery |\n| 24e | CSRF sequels: token bound/checked, SameSite, JSON-body CSRF via bot | gap | token rejected when absent, `SameSite=Strict`, report-to-admin URL | token from own session, text/plain JSON form, GET downgrade | low-med |\n| 24b | open redirect (incl. OAuth `redirect_uri`) | gap | `?next=`/`?return=`/`redirect_uri`, \"after login\" | redirect to a clue route / `//host`; effect JSON | high |\n| 24c | CORS misconfig (reflected Origin + credentials) | gap | `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` echoing Origin, `-Credentials: true` | request with `Origin: null` / attacker | med |\n| 24d | clickjacking / framing | gap | no X-Frame-Options/CSP frame-ancestors, \"one click\" | effect likely judged server-side by headers | low |\n| 25 | prototype pollution (Node) | gap | JSON merge \"settings\", Node/Express/NestJS banner | `{\"__proto__\":{\"isAdmin\":true}}` | med-high (D13 sibling) |\n| 26 | race condition / business logic | gap | shop / wallet / voucher, \"only once\", \"at the same time\" | parallel burst, negative values | med |\n| 27 | password-reset / predictable token / OTP | gap | \"forgot password\", token in response | read the leaked token