{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012LwV3Eww9ouxhhJtngWjg4","type":"tool_result","content":"18\talone (D12 prints its effect with empty rows). Mastery = today's bug + earlier lane-days (3 targets since D08, 4 on\n19\tD15), described only by today's prompt. Pace: D01-D03 cal. 19, D04-D05 cal. 20, D06-D08 cal. 21, D09-D10 cal. 22,\n20\tD11-D13 cal. 23, D14-D15 cal. 24 -> D16-D31 (16 lane-days) over cal. 25-31, ~2-3 per day; priority 1 below = likely\n21\tin D16-D23.\n22\tArc: info-disclosure -> access control -> injection -> file read -> access control -> XSS (reflected, stored) ->\n23\tsession fixation -> CSRF -> upload -> SSTI -> second-order SQLi -> mass assignment -> API field/action authz -> SSRF.\n24\tServer-side/API run since D10; D13-D15 walk the OWASP **API** Top 10 (API3 property-level authz, API5 function-level\n25\tauthz, API7 SSRF; API1 BOLA = D02). Several days are \"one level deeper\" sequels (D10->D11, D03->D12, D05->D13->D14).\n26\tStill-missing API Top 10 items: API2 broken auth (JWT / tokens), API4 resource limits, API6 business flows (race),\n27\tAPI8 misconfig (CORS, verbose debug), API9 improper inventory (old `/v1` or beta endpoint without the check -- D14's\n28\t\"take inventory\" wording points here), API10 unsafe consumption. Still-missing web classics: OS command injection,\n29\tXXE, open redirect, DOM XSS, role via cookie/header, deserialization, prototype pollution, NoSQL, header trust,\n30\tGraphQL, password reset, cache poisoning; SSRF sequels (filters, redirects, file://) and SSTI/upload sequels.\n31\tSnapshot 2026-10-24 (after D15). `lib/web/handlers/__init__.py` holds `session_fixation`, `upload`, `csrf` (+\n32\t`default` ladder) and loads per-day plugins `lib/web/handlers/dayNN_*.py` (each exports `KEY_MAP` + `HANDLERS`; D23\n33\tadded `template_temper` SSTI, `ask_again_later` second-order, `posted_too_much` mass assignment; D24 added\n34\t`day24_web_the_api_has_opinions` (KEY `inventory_route|protected_reference`) and `day24_web_fetch_quest` SSRF).\n35\t`hctf prebuild` still has NO `web` lane and no `web:*` keys exist in `.run/prebuild-state.json` -> every prebuild gap is pending.\n36\t\n37\tStatus legend: `seen Dnn` = GM-confirmed lane-day (solver in `challenges/<cal-day>/web-*/solver/solve.py`, handler in\n38\t`lib/web/handlers/`). `gap` = nothing reusable in lib. Prebuilt web modules must be PURE (no `urllib.request`): bodies\n39\tin -> request plan `[(method, path, headers, body)]` out; response in -> proof or next hints. The solver fetches.\n40\t\n41\t## Coverage table\n42\t\n43\t| # | concept | status | recognition cues | first move | likelihood next 3 cal. days |\n44\t|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n45\t| 1 | exposed backup / forced browsing via robots | seen D01 (Mastery x3) | robots `Disallow: /<word>-<hex>/`, \"crawler policy\", \"archive\" | robots -> index -> every link (depth 2) | done; Mastery |\n46\t| 2 | IDOR (object-level authz) | seen D02 (Mastery x2) | \"Signed in as\", `/<things>/<id>`, `fetch('/api/<things>/'+id)` | foreign ids from `/api/history` | done; Mastery |\n47\t| 3 | SQL injection (tautology) | seen D03 | search form, \"database\", \"one pointed question\" | `zz') OR 1=1 --` family + quote-balanced | done; Mastery |\n48\t| 3b | second-order SQLi (stored value queried later) | seen D12 | \"plant your question inside the data and come back later\", \"delayed echo\", feature 405 `post_required`, secondary `{\"rows\":[],\"effect\":..}` | POST JSON every field = `x' OR '1'='1' -- `, GET secondary; `rows[]` holds proof | done; Mastery |\n49\t| 4 | path traversal / LFI | seen D04 (Mastery) | `?doc=`/`?page=` filename value, \"mounted at /path\" | `../`*10 + prompt path | done; Mastery |\n50\t| 5 | missing function-level authz (unlinked route) | seen D05 (Mastery) | \"staff-only, just a sign\", clue `feature_route` | GET the clue route | done; Mastery |\n51\t| 6 | role / privilege via client-controlled header, query or cookie | gap | `cur